ANACREON 16 SCENARIO
"The Kalgan Frontier"

; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; NEW CONTENT -- NOT A PORT.
;
; The scenario files that shipped with Anacreon: Reconstruction 4021 are not
; available. This one is newly authored against the file format recovered
; from the NEWGAME.PAS parser, and does not reproduce any galaxy the original
; shipped. See docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md section 3.5.
;
; Header fields, in order:
;   seed  minPlayers  maxPlayers  galaxySize  maxPlanets  difficulty
;   minLength  maxLength  firstYear
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

  20250731    1    4    40    90    2    50   200   4021

; --- Introduction ----------------------------------------------------------
; Every scenario needs a BeginText/EndText block: the loader discards every
; token between the header and BeginText, then shows these pages before the
; galaxy is built. NewPage splits pages.

BeginText

                         THE KALGAN FRONTIER

     Beyond the Kalgan Rift the old star charts simply stop. Not because
  anyone surveyed the edge and found nothing -- because the surveyors
  never came back, and the Imperium had larger worries by then.

     A thousand years later the Rift is quiet, the Imperium is a rumour,
  and three young powers have all arrived at the same conclusion within a
  decade of each other: whoever holds the Frontier holds the road back to
  the Core.

     None of them has the strength to take it alone. All of them are
  about to try.

EndText

BeginDescription
A quiet arm of the galaxy, far enough from the old capitals that nobody has
bothered to draw the borders yet. Three powers have noticed it at once.
EndDescription

; --- Distribution tables ---------------------------------------------------
; ClassTable: one weight per world class, in declaration order, summing to
; 100. Order: Amb Ard Art Bar J K L M Drt Eth Fst GsG HLf Ice Jng Ocn Par
; Psn Rns Und Ter Vlc

ClassTable
   2   8   0  10   7   7   7   8   7   9   6   4   2   6   5   5   1   3
   2   1   0   0

; TechTable: one weight per tech level, summing to 100.
; Order: pre-tech primitive pre-atomic atomic pre-warp warp jump bio-tech
;        starship pre-gate gate

TechTable
   6  14  18  20  16  12   8   4   2   0   0

SetTrillumReserves 100

; --- Regions ---------------------------------------------------------------
; Zone 1 defaults to the whole galaxy. These carve out the three home
; territories and the contested middle.

DefineZone 2    2,2     14,14      ; coreward
DefineZone 3   27,2     39,14      ; rimward
DefineZone 4    2,27    14,39      ; trailing
DefineZone 5   15,15    26,26      ; the disputed middle
DefineZone 6   27,27    39,39      ; the deep frontier

DefineXY Kalgan     20,20
DefineXY Vantiss     8,8
DefineXY Sarkhon    33,8
DefineXY Meleth      8,33
DefineXY Korrath    33,33

; --- Empires ---------------------------------------------------------------
; CreatePlayerEmpire: slot  revFactor  techLevel  nExtraTechs [techs...]
;                     nModifiers [modifiers...]
; Slots with no name supplied at load time are skipped, so this scenario
; plays with one to four players.

CreatePlayerEmpire  0   0   6   0   1 Central
CreatePlayerEmpire  1   0   6   0   1 Central
CreatePlayerEmpire  2   0   6   0   1 Central
CreatePlayerEmpire  3   0   6   0   1 Central

; CreateNPEmpire: slot  npeType  name  revFactor  techLevel  nExtraTechs
;                 nModifiers
; npeType 2 = Kingdom1 (passive, easily provoked), 1 = Pirate.

CreateNPEmpire      5   2   "Ondar Concordance"   1   6   0   0
CreateNPEmpire      6   1   RndName               2   5   0   0

; --- Homeworlds ------------------------------------------------------------
