; The Concordance holds the middle with a fortified capital.

CreateWorld 11  Kalgan:-2..2,-2..2   16  6   4  5  1800  75  100
             200 120  300  80      600  60 120  30  20   8  200
            1400   0   0  900 1200 1000  400

; --- Neutral space ---------------------------------------------------------

CreateRandomWorlds  22   5     ; the disputed middle
CreateRandomWorlds  14   6     ; the deep frontier
CreateRandomWorlds  12   1     ; scattered anywhere

; --- Installations ---------------------------------------------------------
; CreateStarbase: n  xy  baseType  tech  type  empire  pop  eff
;                 LAM def GDM ion   fgt hkr jmp jtn pen ssp trn
;                 men nnj amb che met sup tri
; baseType 20 = command base, 23 = outpost.

CreateStarbase  1  Kalgan:-6..6,-6..6  20  6  2  5  120  60
                 60  40  100  20     200  20  40  10   6   2   60
                400   0   0  300  400  300  150

CreateStarbase  2  Z:6                 23  5  11 8   20  40
                  0   0    0   0      20   0   0   0   0   0   10
                 40   0   0   60   60   80   40

; CreateStargate: xy  gateType  empire.  gateType 24 = gate.
CreateStargate  Kalgan:-4..4,-4..4   24  5

; --- Phenomena -------------------------------------------------------------
; CreateNebula: type  upperLeft  lowerRight.  type 1 = nebula, 3 = dense.

CreateNebula  1   16,2    19,13
CreateNebula  3   17,6    18,9

; CreateRandomNebula: kind  min  max.  kind 2 = patches.
CreateRandomNebula  2   4   8

; CreateSRMs: empire  upperLeft  lowerRight. The Concordance mines its
; approaches.
CreateSRMs  5   18,18   23,23

EndScenario
